# HANGTEST=nandps2 (docs/kernel/nandboot_hang_analysis.md, nandpad): nandres
# (plain nandboot + hang watchdog + the two no-map areas) plus CONFIG_PSTORE
# alone: no PSTORE_RAM (no ramoops driver, no Reed-Solomon), no CONSOLE,
# PMSG or COMPRESS. Only pstore_init (the filesystem type and
# /sys/fs/pstore) runs.
# DEBUG IMAGE ONLY: it arms a hardware watchdog, so each run needs the
# owner's OK.
CONFIG_CMDLINE="console=ttyS0,115200n8 marvell_nand.write_window=1741,4091 panic=10 consoleblank=0 timer_mv61x0.hang_wdt=30"
CONFIG_PSTORE=y
# CONFIG_PSTORE_RAM is not set
# CONFIG_PSTORE_CONSOLE is not set
# CONFIG_PSTORE_PMSG is not set
# CONFIG_PSTORE_COMPRESS is not set
